Subject: [PATCH] JSC: include the register layout used by 32-bit DFG calls

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [restore experimental ARM32 JIT]

The 32-bit call paths use BaselineJITRegisters just like their 64-bit
counterpart, but did not include its declaration.

--- a/Source/JavaScriptCore/dfg/DFGSpeculativeJIT32_64.cpp
+++ b/Source/JavaScriptCore/dfg/DFGSpeculativeJIT32_64.cpp
@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@
 #if ENABLE(DFG_JIT)
 
 #include "ArrayPrototype.h"
+#include "BaselineJITRegisters.h"
 #include "CallFrameShuffler.h"
 #include "ClonedArguments.h"
 #include "DFGAbstractInterpreterInlines.h"
